ng, coaching, and developing future ICT professionals Experience in any of the following would be advantageous: Software development, scripting, or automation Cloud platforms and services (e.g., AWS, Azure, GCP, or equivalent enterprise platforms) DevOps, CI/CD pipelines, or platform engineering Containerization or virtualization technologies Systems administration, networking, or infrastructure management Infrastructure‑as‑Code or configuration management tools Web platforms, application hosting, or distributed systems #LI-Hybrid"
